      "quality": "poor",
      "qualityReason": "editorial_filler"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "Every lake and pond in the community is stocked annually with catfish, bass, and crappie, supporting local fishing enthusiasts.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        11
